      "title": "A. O. Smith Rewards Shareholders With 6% Hike in Dividend",
      "summary": "A. O. Smith Corporation increased its quarterly dividend by 6% to 38 cents per share, continuing over 30 years of consecutive dividend hikes. The company generated $233.3 million in free cash flow in the first half of 2026 and repurchased $162.4 million in shares, with plans for $300 million in buybacks for the full year. However, the company faces headwinds in international markets, particularly China.",
